Because Physical AI bridges disciplines that are traditionally separated in university curricula---machine learning, embedded systems, real-time operating systems, and classical dynamics---the text is designed to be intellectually self-contained wherever these fields intersect. You do not need dual doctorates in deep learning and mechanical engineering to read this book. All companion firmware harnesses, hardware schematics, and laboratory benchmarks are hosted online at #link("https://physical.mlsysbook.ai")[#NormalTok("physical.mlsysbook.ai");].

