$ upright(bold(R)) \( t + Delta t \) = upright(bold(R)) \( t \) dot.op exp (bold(omega)^and Delta t) $

$ bold(omega)^and = \[ bold(omega) \]_times = mat(delim: "[", 0, - omega_z, omega_y; omega_z, 0, - omega_x; - omega_y, omega_x, 0) in frak(s o) \( 3 \) $

