$ exp (bold(omega)^and Delta t) = upright(bold(I)) + frac(sin \( theta \), theta) bold(omega)^and Delta t + frac(1 - cos \( theta \), theta^2) \( bold(omega)^and Delta t \)^2 \, quad theta = parallel bold(omega) parallel Delta t $

