=== Non-Generative World Modeling via Joint-Embedding Predictive Architectures
<non-generative-world-modeling-via-joint-embedding-predictive-architectures>
Physical AI avoids pixel rendering by utilizing Latent World Models. These architectures predict environmental dynamics entirely within compact, information-dense latent representation spaces $upright(bold(z)) in cal(Z) subset bb(R)^d$, discarding task-irrelevant visual entropy while preserving the underlying physical invariants.

