+ #strong[Implement Generative Trajectory Decoders:] Construct parallel multi-step decoders using Action Chunking with Transformers (ACT) and Conditional Diffusion Policies conditioned on visual affordances and proprioceptive state @zhao2023learning@chi2023diffusionpolicy.
+ #strong[Architect Lock-Free SRAM Queues:] Design Single-Producer Single-Consumer (SPSC) circular ring buffers with hardware memory barriers and zero dynamic heap allocation (#NormalTok("malloc = 0");) for deterministic inter-core communication.
