#strong[Failure Mechanism:] To reduce onboard compute costs and thermal dissipation, the high-level VLA policy was offloaded to an edge 5G server; entering a cold-storage vault created an RF multipath and shadow blackout of $1 \, 420 upright(" ms")$. \
