#strong[Physical Consequence:] The vehicle coasted unguided for $2.556 upright(" m")$ ($+ 1.356 upright(" m")$ past physical obstacle clearance), smashing into a structural steel pillar at $1.8 upright(" m/s")$ ($E_k = 1 \, 944 upright(" J")$), shearing the front steering kingpin, rupturing hydraulic lines, and crushing lithium battery modules ($42 \, 000 upright(" USD")$ overhaul).

