The architectural discipline of runtime governance rests on four foundational pillars:

+ #strong[Deterministic Authority State Machines:] Human-machine authority is arbitrated by a bare-metal 4-state engine (#NormalTok("ESTOP"); $succ$ #NormalTok("MANUAL"); $succ$ #NormalTok("SHARED_ADMITTANCE"); $succ$ #NormalTok("AUTONOMOUS");) running in static SRAM with optocoupler-isolated Safe Torque Off ($< 5 thin mu upright("s")$) and $20 upright(" ms")$ bidirectional dual-heartbeat watchdogs.
