+ #strong[DAgger Episode Slicing and Demarcation:] The policy endogeneity trap is eliminated by tagging every telemetry frame with hardware IEEE 1588 PTP timestamps and non-forgeable $upright(bold(1))_(upright("human_active"))$ register bits. Pre-takeover drift sequences ($t_(upright("takeover")) - T_(upright("pre")) lt.eq t < t_(upright("takeover"))$) are excised into $cal(D)_(upright("failure"))$ for hazard analysis, while post-takeover recoveries are captured as DAgger demonstrations ($cal(D)_(upright("recovery_dagger"))$).
