where the constraint matrix $upright(bold(A)) in bb(R)^(K times m)$ and vector $upright(bold(b)) in bb(R)^K$ stack both the $M$ barrier constraints and the $2 m$ box limits ($K = M + 2 m$):

$ upright(bold(A)) = mat(delim: "[", L_g h_1 \( upright(bold(x)) \); dots.v; L_g h_M \( upright(bold(x)) \); upright(bold(I))_(m times m); - upright(bold(I))_(m times m)) \, #h(2em) upright(bold(b)) = mat(delim: "[", - L_f h_1 \( upright(bold(x)) \) - gamma_1 h_1 \( upright(bold(x)) \); dots.v; - L_f h_M \( upright(bold(x)) \) - gamma_M h_M \( upright(bold(x)) \); upright(bold(u))_(upright("min")); - upright(bold(u))_(upright("max"))) $

