$ upright(bold(K))_k upright(bold(S))_k = upright(bold(P))_(k \| k - 1) upright(bold(H))_k^T arrow.r.double.long upright(bold(K))_k = upright(bold(P))_(k \| k - 1) upright(bold(H))_k^T upright(bold(S))_k^(- 1) $

#heading(level: 3, numbering: none)[Structural Proof of the Joseph Stabilized Covariance Form]
