$ T_j \( t \) = T_(upright("ambient")) + P_(upright("step")) \( R_(theta \, upright("jc")) + R_(theta \, upright("ca")) \) [1 - frac(tau_1 e^(- t \/ tau_1) - tau_2 e^(- t \/ tau_2), tau_1 - tau_2)] $

where $tau_1 \, tau_2$ are the dominant thermal time constants of the silicon package ($1 upright("–") 5 upright(" s")$) and the physical chassis ($60 upright("–") 300 upright(" s")$).

- #strong[Proactive Thermal Derating Boundary:] If $T_j \( t \) gt.eq T_(upright("warn")) = 75.0^compose upright("C")$, the firmware triggers proactive cadence scaling ($50 upright(" Hz") arrow.r 20 upright(" Hz")$, $H = 16 arrow.r 32$), dropping $P_(upright("compute"))$ by $55 %$ before junction temperature reaches the destructive hardware DVFS throttling knee ($T_(upright("trip")) = 85.0^compose upright("C")$).

