  [#strong[engineering notebook]], [An accumulating, versioned engineering record tracking specifications, contracts, and test evidence for a physical system.],
  [#strong[Delegated Physical Authority]], [The permission granted to an autonomous system to energize actuators and move matter without continuous human physical intervention.],
